 "text": "Land Records Search | Berrien County, MI\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\n-->\nGovernment\nResources\nDepartments\nBusiness\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nAbout the Register of Deeds\nAdditional Resources\nCopies & Searches\ne-Recording\nFees\nLand Records Search\nProperty Fraud Alert\nRecording Requirements\nRegister of Deeds FAQs\nTransfer Tax Rate Chart (PDF)\nUniform Commercial Code\nHome\nDepartments\nRegister of Deeds\nLand Records Search\nLand Records Search\nSearch Public Documents Recorded after Sept 8, 2026\nTapestry EON\nFor images September 8, 2026, and forward. Tapestry EON is available as a web-based search service that allows users to search land records and indices. This service has an $8.75 fee per search and is ideal for one-time or casual searching. Copies of images have a statutory $1.00 per page fee.\nLaredo Anywhere\nFor images September 8, 2026, and forward. Laredo Anywhere is a downloadable program that allows users to search land records for a monthly fee. This service is ideal for regular or professional searching. Download an Online Access Agreement (PDF) and forward to LFreehling@berriencounty.org to get started.\nSearch Public Documents Recorded before Sept. 8, 2026\nGovOS Cloud Search is recommend for general / casual users*\nFull text search (OCR) or legible / typed text\n*This website is mobile friendly. | CountyFusion Search is recommended for the experienced user*\nSearch by name, recorded date and liber / page\n*This website functions best using a PC and requires a stable internet connection. Chrome or Edge are the preferred browsers and please allow pop ups for this website.\n|\nCareers\nMake a\nPayment\nPublic\nMeetings\nSilver Beach\nWebCam\nProperty\nSearch\nInmate\nSearch\nParks & Rec\nTrial Court\nRoad Dept.\nHealth Dept.\nSheriff & Jail\n-->\nWebsite Sign in\nContact Us\nBerrien County Administration Center\n701 Main Street, Saint Joseph, MI 49085\n(269) 983-7111\nEmail Us | Directories\nHelpful Links\nFrequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\nHoliday Closing Schedule\nFinancial Transparency\nLocal Municipality Websites\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGet Involved\nCareers\nVolunteer\nDonate\nElections\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nAccessibility\nPrivacy\nCopyright Information\nSiteMap\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\n[]\nPageAssist\nDiscover your personalization options\nClose ×",
